{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q847399","formula":"C₁₂H₉N₃O","hill":"C12H9N3O","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":12.0,"H":9.0,"N":3.0,"O":1.0},"names":{"en":"Milrinone","uk":"Мілринон"},"descriptions":{"en":"Milrinone, sold under the brand name Primacor among others, is a pulmonary vasodilator used in patients who have heart failure. It is a phosphodiesterase 3 inhibitor that works to increase the heart's contractility and decrease pulmonary vascular resistance. Milrinone also works to vasodilate which helps alleviate increased pressures (afterload) on the heart, thus improving its pumping action.","uk":"Мілринон (INN: Milrinone) — інгібітор фосфодіестерази типу 3. Використовують для лікування серцевої недостатності. Фармакотерапевтична група: C01CE02 - неглікозидні кардіотонічні засоби."},"fame":22,"pubchemCid":4197,"mass":211.22,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC1=C(C=C(C(=O)N1)C#N)C2=CC=NC=C2","inchikey":"PZRHRDRVRGEVNW-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"6-methyl-2-oxo-5-pyridin-4-yl-1H-pyridine-3-carbonitrile","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"4197","atoms":25,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-3.813,"y":-1.133,"z":0.0,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.607,"y":-1.783,"z":0.0,"el":"N"},{"x":4.295,"y":0.746,"z":0.0,"el":"N"},{"x":-3.908,"y":2.498,"z":0.0,"el":"N"},{"x":0.153,"y":-0.205,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.254,"y":-1.495,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":1.575,"y":0.122,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.858,"y":0.845,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.173,"y":0.586,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":0.637,"y":-2.706,"z":0.001,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.619,"y":-0.84,"z":-0.001,"el":"C"},{"x":2.25,"y":0.277,"z":1.202,"el":"C"},{"x":2.251,"y":0.277,"z":-1.203,"el":"C"},{"x":3.6,"y":0.587,"z":1.149,"el":"C"},{"x":3.6,"y":0.587,"z":-1.149,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.128,"y":1.638,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.498,"y":1.872,"z":0.0,"el":"H